#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:5
msgid "Create a PDF from a project"
msgstr "从项目创建 PDF"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:7
msgid ""
"The active `project`_  can be exported to PDF from the `menu bar`_, "
"`toolbar`_ and using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"活动 `项目 <project_>`_ 可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中导出到 "
"PDF,并使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:12
msgid ""
"Check that the active `project`_ is the project that should be printed."
msgstr "请检查archive `项目 <project_>`_ 是应该打印的项目。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:16
msgid ""
"The current version from QElectroTech, version 0.7, does not allow keeping "
"the element links on the PDF document."
msgstr "QElectroTech目前版本的0.7版本不允许保留PDF文档上的元素链接。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:20
msgid "Export project to PDF from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏导出项目到 PDF"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:22
msgid "Select **File > Print** menu item to open the printing PopUp window."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 打印** 菜单项打开打印 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:23
msgid "Select Print to PDF a file check button."
msgstr "选择打印到 PDF 文件检查按钮 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:24
msgid "Select the directory where to save the PDF file"
msgstr "选择保存 PDF 文件的目录"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:29
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech printing PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 打印弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:31
msgid "Press **Ok** Button to open the preview printing PopUp window."
msgstr "按 **Ok** 按钮打开预览打印 PopUp 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:36
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech printing preview PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 打印预览"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:38
msgid "Select the `folios`_ that should be printed."
msgstr "选择要打印的 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:39
msgid "Select the printing option."
msgstr "选择打印选项。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:40
msgid "Press **Print** Button."
msgstr "按 **Print** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:44
msgid ""
"If the folio list is not display, select the icon |icon_folio_list| from the"
" toolbar."
msgstr "如果folio列表未显示，请从工具栏中选择图标 |icon_folio_list| 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:47
msgid "icon_folio_list"
msgstr "图标 folio list"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:45
msgid ""
"If the print options panel is not display, select the icon "
"|icon_print_options| from the toolbar."
msgstr "如果打印选项面板没有显示，请从工具栏中选择图标 |icon_print_options|."

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:48
msgid "icon_print_options"
msgstr "图标打印选项"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:51
msgid "Export project to PDF from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏导出项目到 PDF"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:53
msgid ""
"Select the icon |document-print| from the `toolbar`_ to open the printing "
"PopUp window."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 打开打印的 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:56
msgid "document-print"
msgstr "文档打印"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:54
#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:68
msgid ""
"Follow the steps defined at the ``printing project from menu bar`` section."
msgstr "遵循 ``printing project from menu bar`` 节确定的步骤。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:60
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**"
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 显示"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:63
msgid "Export project to PDF using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键导出项目到 PDF"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:65
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:67
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + p`` to open the printing PopUp window."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + p`` 打开打印的 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/create_pdf.rst:72
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
